    <code code="42349-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Reason for referral (narrative)"/>
    <title>Reason for Referral</title>
    <text><paragraph>Please evaluate and advise on chronic diastolic (congestive) heart failure and hypertensive heart disease with heart failure. [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Cardiology referral to confirm the diagnosis, review the echocardiogram, and look for specific causes such as amyloidosis or valve disease. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
