    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Heart failure with preserved ejection fraction, NYHA class II to III at diagnosis; synthetic modern diagnosis linked to the documented 1785 heart failure: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Hypertensive heart disease with heart failure: active, confirmed [S]</item></list><paragraph>Coordinated follow-up with the primary clinician is appropriate. [S]</paragraph></text>

